# Build context hygiene for both Dockerfiles (context = repository root).
# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image; host copies
# are architecture-specific and would shadow the clean install.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.pnpm-store
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# Prisma's client is regenerated by the API build (prebuild -> prisma generate).
apps/api/src/generated

# Local env files must never be baked into an image. Prod values are supplied
# by docker-compose.prod.yml at runtime.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Repo metadata and dev-only files.
.git
.gitignore
.reasonix
.vscode
docs
README.md
